for the business. Some folks think that she’s childish at times, but she has an unexpected maturity about her which she uses to manage various situations. Called a therianthrope, Masaki is a hybrid of human and beast, which makes her have human-like features, along with a tail and ears of the therianthrope species. This species closely resembles a wolf. Loves eating, but especially favors donuts, of which Masaki claims “I have a different stomach for donuts”."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Danny Choo's blog and Visual Novels and Eroge Review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12413"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"獣のような耳と尻尾が生えた、セリアンスロープの元気な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公-鷺ノ森透が下宿する家の一人娘で、明るく気さくな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家は『牙と爪の獣亭』という酒場を経営しており、看板娘として働いてもいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美味しい食べ物には目がなく、最近のお気に入りはドーナツ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供っぽいと思われることもあるが、意外と大人っぽい一面もあり、まとめ役になることも多い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"962","sourceWorkId":"18290","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"獣のような耳と尻尾が生えた、セリアンスロープの元気な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公・鷺ノ森透が下宿する家の一人娘で、明るく気さくな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家は 『牙と爪の獣亭』 という酒場を経営しており、看板娘として働いてもいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美味しい食べ物には目がなく、最近のお気に入りはドーナツ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供っぽいと思われることもあるが、意外と大人っぽい一面もあり、まとめ役になることも多い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"19288"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a0e4d0431ba5a3df03687909cabb7b184a6f6631fa34efacf6c2f43cffc2da15.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/9862cb7c469072f9d5f1899d9ad81cc77117099951495105e6dba248dd2237d2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"種﨑敦美","creatorId":"vndb:s196","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s196","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s196","name":"種﨑 敦美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-